\end{align}
Note that $D_L$ can be partitioned into $D_L\cap E_{1L}$, $D_L\cap E_{2L}$, and $D_L\cap E_{3L}.$
By Lemmas \ref{lem:star-current}, \ref{lem:star-current_inner}, and \ref{lem:case3}, there exists a constant $M>0$ such that, respectively,
