\end{multline}
where the second equality follows from \eqref{eq:eiconv8} and \eqref{eq:eiconv13}. Since $\gamma>0$ can be made aribitrarily large, one may let the second term on the right hand side of \eqref{eq:eiconv14} converge to 0 faster than the first term. Therefore
\begin{align}
