By Part \ref{cor:eam_conv:c_mollified_Lip} and the definition of $\hat c_{n,\rho,\tau}$ in \eqref{eq:def_chat_nrhotau}, it follows that
\begin{align}
\hat c_{n,\rho,\tau_n}(\theta_n)&\ge \hat c_{n,\rho}(\theta_n)-e_n\\
