Denote $B^d_{n,\rho}\equiv \frac{\sqrt n}{\rho }(\Theta-\theta_n)\cap B^d$, with $B^d = \{x \in \mathbb{R}^d:|x_i| \le 1, i=1,\dots,d\}$.
