yielding a new definition of the set $U_n^*$ as
\begin{align*}
U_n^*(\theta_n,c)\equiv	\big\{\lambda\in \bar{\mathfrak{W}}^*(\bar{c}): p^\prime \lambda = 0 \cap u^*_{n,j,\theta_n}(\lambda)\le c, \: \forall j=1,\dots,J\big\}.
