Suppose first $j\in\mathcal R_1\cap \mathcal J^*$ and $j+R_1\notin \mathcal J^*$. Then, $\pi^*_{1,j}=0$ and $\pi^*_{1,j+R_1}=-\infty$. Then, 
\begin{align}
